{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1352,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebd6b69cea8ed66afa69edf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好多闪亮亮的新生哦──！\r\n好想跟大家变成朋友哦──♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd5541705ca9cd9839b6f725bf6502367f8fef7e5d22b668ef92698e316dfe6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:203975fc0c058bbb9d8cf897",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热啊！\r\n大家一起去吃胡萝卜冰嘛──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ba4d61014895f346c1bf4539921195b8b6f5d93d6490313f1e069c07204248f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b065478f977bc906e9e944c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在红叶落地之前……抓住！\r\n这跟咬面包比赛一样好玩哦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "67f7072dab75add6a5f18a6e2d247eba4d8d7526825fe77a58d6019513d2b7cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:432fca3e2a3c877b2a7884fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想跟大家一起打雪仗，\r\n又想跟大家窝在暖炉桌吃橘子……\r\n嗯──应该选哪个好啊──？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9640db5a19286d908b85b596ce86ed7d1327f483e7b330350e926098cdd041b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f16b2f80811b6f4135bcec3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要摆出小歌帮我想的\r\n最强和服造型姿势了！\r\n……像蔷薇一样，可爱绽放！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e5ac1b84cbdc026ba6118891bed4fcef6ea76afda63614093f1c6d6b5ac35cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53c65bb1074d531acca7b954",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帝王的手是有魔法的手！\r\n因为她把头发转来转去！\r\n就能绑出这么漂亮的样子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "909fe6742be1d3660e4f35ec6a5a1c140fef7ec1c7bde454da3d4c4f49c17e04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8dc6c465654f8991feb3595",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～呼～呼～呼……好了！\r\n新年参拜喝甜酒的练习非常完美！\r\n下次不会再烫到舌头了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c43dda62764f036cc29c7c04179635746d747fcc1111f8372ca999e50df3b249",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d9a108c4007419bfc8fbd3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸欸！我们来种「柚子」吧！\r\n我也想在过年的时候\r\n发送给大家～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec4916c8b61207a86c32b1fbb62d1d67bbdf8dc8d736cb022cff75e8ddecfa03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8ec97536def2dcb13de8aac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "红包袋让人很兴奋呢！\r\n会想说里面到底放了什么～\r\n希望会是胡萝卜脆片！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d34bac5f49e4eb1126a147bf21860226ab29ce11eb68a7d33026e7adaceff38a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ab4ddf2d5144e0ed29a17f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有用书法写下今天的目标！\r\n「要和学园的所有人打招呼」！\r\n好──我要加油～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5fb481665eccbeb1c555a751cb07e5dba21645330b5c485442de618a8e2404a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5a336f7d17d55a05ac162be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上国语课的时候有出现和小福\r\n一起学会的和歌！被老师夸说\r\n「真亏你知道」呢！嘿嘿嘿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e1c77f42d6a262165e5171409e385c49ca3a1959f7b623e82f48fb5f4faedbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c786b235aa1d8d28d0670eca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天要早起看日出！\r\n然后去找训练员！\r\n这样就能比平常多玩一点了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f74e0a6a66ba563ae38346f41205935d0cc69fa087925bfdeb5d16069a411ffe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b49f7dd9387365181f3614ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新春、新春──！\r\n嘿嘿嘿～！感觉只是说出口，\r\n就能让人跑得更快呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df2b4fdc915e6c53d57866f2c2831503875c119853656f14c7f21134d98a6eff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40c75bb168c4a17488592826",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这身和服，也能跳\r\n夜来舞呢！拿着鸣子响板，\r\n发出嚓嚓嚓的声音！喝啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "294590d5c70c186d1015451a5142382642770a533cee575ec33c2e52d2f3d5a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30ecb26fe502958f6da12528",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜～！吃太多地瓜了，\r\n肚子好胀……\r\n没有大一点的和服裤吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "828a62e32fba445346d7e630f6f3a3c16e93a303ac0f63de4ae23e17078918bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e2f7797bee5d57050ca79b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦咦──！？长距离接力赛\r\n不是拿狸猫跑，而是拿布条吗？\r\n得去告诉小涛才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2132077b7f95dbbcf694010d7e3a474aed32e2f707db1c5f39059b3bf0ec3d95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b08334e1e8bc0bda0b733836",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "系和服的布条会让人整个挺直！\r\n变得立正站好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb55f11176cbc5955a838be00bc9a4c99daf422c688db231bbb2ba495ed76566",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:052d2036aa651c4cbb26d5de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着这身和服转圈圈，\r\n就会看起来像陀螺一样喔！\r\n眼睛也会一起转来转去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2190a0af556e1d8b9ef4dddca8f1c64dabb4824275558fb13006098fdb8a1cca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df462894e6b3595ef82182e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一、二！一、二！\r\n热身操已经做好了哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d79bec5dd2f5959f35a31e69a23afa4f862f6b844d0480aa431c0f19ffbbac8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98eaff18d7a88c5848df3f6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "えいえいおー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "775ca50961ed54879efa1865c77b21cd1ec6d682b5e51e1c4328c4b272ff5435",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d32cea777b8c6e953b11d654",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练吗？好啊。\r\n刚好我的点心时间也结束了嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0904e467206c0378013384b72240395225d82792bd1fe08ac74d879c21e22c18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70998360906c766399b56930",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力做训练的话，会有奖励的吧？\r\n好──我要开始做了──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "357dd96cc21855b4005b34df9a402ffbe54a782a215bb89ce6f1cac8c1f0c71f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2427684358413ad7fb0b7d6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要从什么开始做呢──？\r\n我想要做很有趣的训练啊──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a226509ae2493624d644fe7f20df38df0770e174ce93a0cc23c214a4b81a7ac9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f79cb6d8bfa64094b8985102",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练的时候真的好开心哦──\r\n因为真的会感觉到自己变强了嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a72c3e294796ba9475feafa6aba31e2c821c6aba1d13d2621ff1a215b0568dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7522332aac5a7cd753988cd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我变得比原本还要能跑更久了哦！\r\n好开心哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "74d6df1d597a2574d1ee5c1e7e3145681ca6acd1d28f7a0a8f330fcbce6098ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7968b52336ab0baa4e3b2947",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要不屈不挠就一定能获胜！\r\n我们继续多多训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e0b05c3149e8c012f68409655e5c3d8d4de3b2dfd6bad7eade3b84f12307fae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fd483d8317d99aed4fdceeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要做什么样的训练呢──？\r\n好期待，好期待♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a616ca3b4d48480cd8520f9497c47531df87d5750dc0dd486c564fbaa4f6207",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:426f1cde7a9cc98cbe2ad7d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的我可是不太「一样」喔！\r\n不对，是二、三……嗯──！\r\n是不太很多样！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8727da15fd4c44a9bc7a3cbe6dbdb55955f5b87dee973a3371e94a8617d41836",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eba503c7e7c833cb71833e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和米米玩了\r\n很──久的板羽球！\r\n不过还是很有精神喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a5b51b6b0c07e4dadb3032d89dddd7a262a3a42c604b553894efeb2f79895f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3341adb82789ee429ec9b40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸欸！不知道要做什么练习的话～\r\n用抽签来决定怎么样？\r\n一定会很有趣喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8d5cdadc2c913f136449bbc5d0cec5f3c0553149713925b4b28af30ac96d17c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:433fb1111d55d650504cdb0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "参拜的时候啊，我有和神\r\n做了约定！说我会非──常\r\n拼命地跑！要祂好好看着我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2108ca353195666dea7cbe5832355ad54b55df7648af3bd95624e2b22b95a8c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4957370c5a29ee85bb2843cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对了！我用训练员的脸\r\n做了笑福面～！\r\n等等一起玩喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a41fd26759f5bebf4b581e582e8684c69765a1f1cb5a4869966e1af6d8dcd2dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:334857f5fc6e2c40c8330c1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会在今年给训练员的贺年卡\r\n写上很──多「谢谢」喔！\r\n可能会多到明信片都写不下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cadea456777228ee567d485b5287c0a5e287abf3676aaf849f04248bf3ec0796",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:229e6fb57eb3e42513a403a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员明年也来\r\n高知过年吧！我会告诉你\r\n哪里可以看到最美的日出！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e926131bd09272413a128ad8cd9d49ea8254b1fb05f6af121a41041f0ade9d13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ea4280c7b6b5f20c5fe0390",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的我是不会输给任何人的～♪\r\n对吧？训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5527157e051085368921701a4ffac482fd9a81f963ed0e9302e6754c52e7cc02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4dc3abc9ea1c9396367b8ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快称赞我、快称赞我～给我胡萝卜♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2d550de68fec552d15a8ba45c5ea08a53f0bd5fb72bc1e06696914feac1c281",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7029a4bb620333ace9b2dcea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明年和之后的每一年！\r\n都一起开心地乌～菈菈～♪吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13dbe0b19f98696d488dc8108ea790c3ad8be0f66b447607eacbbe214530fbe0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05826cfbd573ca0a0d159ec7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像麻糬一样\r\n膨胀成长了喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ad38c91fe2c2b4cba117228b5d81d1f87b637b0be8c7f5e44c7974b43536e5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7dd012c31f0f7fce149449a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咻──！我是不是还长高了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3de83e7eaed9a5d11cd7801c1ea5e45fb063eea069fc6cdf20d01094faefcf70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2da6844a9215368399c6384",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定会变得更～好玩的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dcdc6b2616e575d6c8ec5a65e4bc5967d4dd8244fea410acb65b3d9434628d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef02ffcbc4d8737804115373",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春丽，会努力的──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39484dfd9f7c6a2163c7c16e492dd4a8f0def030b0a8a9811e93edb3d7c23762",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0182068bbea1f8c7b3370b69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会努力让你也能依靠我的──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97290dabe95cfc2d1b9c8cf23e27683d881f5a6085ced68a104e8990195222d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e694b5cb8d9cd6d2d8f16a8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会非～常努力帮忙的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2100fde6892cce34e09c8fa599d535f3a8ae62d35bf1dd7104e2f2e2490d6e0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9697e2bdced1c12da5d15fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇──！也要加上很多麻糬喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e53c9e1f2f1f60622e8e6c9f855e8ea174d2ac9ba0b2af94913581d5da553674",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c748506a3970354dd58943cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像放风筝一样\r\n直线升高──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bfb44cbac20caf1efcdef0835ec0e2fb9d922a4027ddbe83adfe911406d6b87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7868894f86d2836a916fa653",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年呜～啦啦～♪\r\n一起度过让人兴奋的一年吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80b982b36567ecaeac936b8d493f2a8c1e3346e0045fce67da4b815cf1354f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abd0651e5fa83c41cb04215e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新春！春丽喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a8e042d9466cf99de7020d38a1ae144650f5d730bf6001b2847c009e3151d5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:748b7624cca01dff02c6889b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，我们上吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "838ab60b7dcb3865d29365de2f655638346aebfa2b6d84f42e0651a825e7f081",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed44aeab1b0751620a468e79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为有绝对不能输的对手！！\r\n还有这股绝对不会冷却的热情！\r\n我才能够持续燃烧热血奔跑！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d8c5c479bb66d6ddc30e2acb2f4d3d488a5aeed7c57a4b652886cdfd4f6ca5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3a436aa518da3b8a3f2e5c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきまっス！",
      "source_fingerprint": "116f115d1ae69c0ab7633919d7b4b8af18b873fcbdab709041c484026a7124ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cc10c695d8459c450c0f6c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戻ったっス！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b74253c5cd75a331ec4ced4c6eec95abba90278fa87a03c2780aba865b40bdb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30055e93766d9766aa352503",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论接下来的路途有多艰辛！！\r\n我相信只要是和训练员一起，\r\n就一定能够克服所有难关！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d4daa369e019bb3291ae08ca11875e9c47bd5dca1a17088a3f81b6b40290def",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a8121d2a11b312e1d06ca7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自从听训练员教过之后，\r\n我就一直有好好保养指甲！\r\n嘿嘿，我绝对不会忘记这份恩情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "752ba1b76590c3c8d58bfe56b9de91615c8574120e0ff1b1a578c6d8de08b290",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c584727c0c234ec32ab05b0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\r\n就用「维护纪律大激战」\r\n作为今年的抱负怎么样！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0be0365690af2d599c8460da3518613dbc5dcc4c968e3a6f3136672cded9e77a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3a97790b695ed83abacf3e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巧克力吗？\r\n校规没有规定不能带巧克力，\r\n所以可以光明正大地送喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f297c96f135aab376fc94d4e635a75d003186d51c4f8af24eba572ca4fda72a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9d3cfe185d3b3d49e428ede",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想送训练员亲手做的\r\n巧克力，所以正在特训！！\r\n今天一定要成功！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b01cf7dedd8091c7664240cb2b5183ca2c890a1eab33052a7371e3656fd0e50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78339d5f073e441104b5813f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕啊！虽然我也有想许的愿望，\r\n但难得的七夕，\r\n我比较想替人实现愿望！",
      "source_fingerprint": "652b65d4b48bcb80b4d5a28b1267d891dbe1f90c426425f3e946fd7593e011fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fb72903e6f2e841c225f3df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果不谨守纪律，\r\n我就会捣蛋喔～！\r\n……咦？好像哪里不太对？",
      "source_fingerprint": "645fe593354a8af5352d6e191c4c4a29d078a275e7f6b5ae52ef0c7d90790ea1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f06568e8c57de6af833194af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果圣诞老人真的存在，\r\n我身为纠察队员，究竟该怎么\r\n应对才正确呢！？嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "34ef4263e57449ebc92f055c6d3ca181c39f50307718745735f2bfd7e53b01f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cf466714382125db20ad793",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞节就是要和重要的伙伴\r\n一起吃烤鸡！所以……\r\n训练员，我们一起吃吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a817b99e089f013f6a90a877d3025140b933ee0cb2a9af81695f1965ab7c9853",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97494759c17bb778236f5cfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啊！获胜了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14cf93f2e6812c22efa2dc81b2fd56850468f15c59c7e82557b72dd9fc994ce3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4fae341b04c15fad5c1b44c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一听到是忙碌的腊月，\r\n就会强烈地想奔跑起来！！\r\n唔喔喔喔～～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "effb4c210ae802c94b5019683c17dac27b392c7ad4f1e1182b30f58f94d5f06b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5355e81ac2cacccb25f8a1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟是生日，要大肆庆祝一下吗？\r\n啊，不过还是要遵守规则喔！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d24a6385a429ea1b3dbefa8fd149e689f74137d2933aa8699a7ae09a5992cd62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b1ed6e8c262177c84c7f112",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！！\r\n我也想成为像训练员\r\n那样出色的大人！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20784b12da92bbf089144b58c9f594896919c945764defc51e122fe5a7a72601",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78953c230ef30d3f75285570",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要训练！\r\n既然长大了一岁，\r\n如果没跟着变强就太逊了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab3b640393230fc62533220fcbd0065d3484d7966d95e23ed408e66c4b30e30a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ddb47731d323f3231327653",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你的祝贺！总觉得有点\r\n难为情……但我想再听一次！\r\n……可以吗？嘿嘿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9953b87522d1b7390790a2b04dfedc01ac1fd739d47a467bc0867e53cec091f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a1e1d84bc5e301afda5a2b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有新公告喔！！\r\n确认公告很重要呢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7115cc9a251e58f786e18a4fc3bce96f3f485ec204651838dbfed0b91d8b57d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af5fe6f57c537ced3fdfaafe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物喔！\r\n如果需要帮忙检查内容，\r\n要赶紧跟我说喔！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64787f5a6260709779eacfa4d7c372fff2e62f6d8224b96bfcca0c264c179e48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2db0b216f8844653144c4ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你达成任务了！\r\n真了不起！！\r\n我也要好好加油！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52539904ae3cbec2a4d9dfd0058ce5873e559869e930a558a130dd7fdd3f3cf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38ed052c50db71cfa089192e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有活动呢！！\r\n谨守纪律，\r\n做好觉悟进行挑战吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fb3f06872eb64409255c77100e1b3f9f973d4adca299d47698707c110ece23f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:322a611a88d9720124216891",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在举办活动！\r\n要遵守规则，\r\n全力享受喔！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66469d65d3f0149e0c9709f7bb03800821039a08a77f126c5461abbfedb302d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd8a4b9c1b7c4291b77ef6fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要再加油！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f64d13c5e431ef4a5e1fe7dad3192d7c2ac79489bafa1e13880b06d1fe5696f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4c7251f3e35681fbfdc022c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册的等级提升了！\r\n去确认一下吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c039586051e3fdf9a3aa41e414ba69dd7c0ad08a72208f69d9880cfee86109ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22bbe1820c3e94f0be4fedc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "動きやすいのが1番っスよ！\r\n街中で問題行動を見つけた時、\r\nすぐ捕まえられるんで！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcecc5cdfb1e20c6a372059e613f314df5f0d5412df4b6916db2abbc7eaeb768",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fcb450cbb00f73fe5a20886",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昔は休日も学園ジャージでした！\r\nけどシチーと同室になってから、\r\n私服も買うようになったっスね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20ddd5530e3d1616dcbe121accfb8a8518345f5412fb4ce5d50328051a1f4351",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e639c8b5109697c5339b8c77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヤエノも同じ寮なんスけど、たまに\r\n洗濯物が交ざって。気づかず着て、\r\nお互い『あっ！』てなるんスよ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6654e148dfe6bd31296fcf1e5d4981a15a849ea594c300d0e717bee48071e78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b1ab936d7c89b9150c3c021",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是一场热血的比赛呢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a755371f281cca1cf2ad368672c9e48e7325d23b20dd8f043f2cb822450f704",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc9fad326ea64669316684f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒啦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dce5e53a3a41f538bd03c6aff78fc1a0ebdf61ef7f2009a06036a1c659ba51c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e42b05c0a48f350c96597ac8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要再加油！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f64d13c5e431ef4a5e1fe7dad3192d7c2ac79489bafa1e13880b06d1fe5696f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a186c68aa1694245dd189ed3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是一场热血的比赛呢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a755371f281cca1cf2ad368672c9e48e7325d23b20dd8f043f2cb822450f704",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "1006"
      ]
    }
  ]
